Z||000000||NoCAChpt,Sacramento||10-05-2001||04:50 PM||||The Sacramento area Fiero Club will be hosting a drive in the Sacramento-San Joaquin Delta on Sunday, October 21.  We'll be gathering at the golf course parking lot  in Freeport, in the south area of Sacramento on Sunday at 9:15 a.m.  We'll drive through the Delta, using at least one of two ferries to get to Rio Vista on the banks of the Sacramento River.  Lunch will be at "The Point."  <P>Respond to this notice on this board with your e-mail or phone number and we'll get back to you with personnally with other details as needed.<P>Ed L. ||||reg||1
